		'Hm... What’s this place?'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		\L_00ecb:
		ZH 1:
		'Rance stopped at a somewhat'
		R
		'strange booth in a corner of'
		R
		'the room.'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		\L_00e93:
		ZH 1:
		'...Why are soy sauce and ponzu'
		R
		'sauce sitting on someone’s'
		R
		'work desk?'
		\L_00fb8:
		ZH 1:
		'And there’s RC models and'
		R
		'fishing rods lying around...'
		\L_00fb8:
		ZH 1:
		'Is the owner of this booth an'
		R
		'idiot?'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		\L_00ecb:
		ZH 1:
		'Rance shrugged with'
		R
		'astonishment.'
		\L_00fb8:
		ZH 1:
		'His eyes suddenly stopped on a'
		R
		'book on the desk.'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		\L_00e93:
		ZH 1:
		'What’s this?'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		\L_00ecb:
		ZH 1:
		'The title on it was...'
		\L_00fb8:
		ZH 1:
		R
		'　　Moomin - A Diary of Love'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		\L_00e93:
		ZH 1:
		'...It’s guaranteed. This booth'
		R
		'belongs to an idiot.'
		R
		'Without a doubt.'
		\L_00fb8:
		\L_00fab:
		@L_0023c:
	}
	{VAR0776 \ 0:
