*L_00312:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s see...'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00ecb:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance turned the page.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ×/◎ Today I had free time.'
	R
	'When TADA noticed I got'
	R
	'instructions from him.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Moomin, are you helping with'
	R
	'Rance?'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Yeah, you can count on me.'
	R
	'I got this!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］ Then do everything'
	R
	'related to JAPAN. Bug testing,'
	R
	'writing, everything.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'By yourself.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Geh!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］ You’ll be fine, there’s'
	R
	'already roughs drafts for the'
	R
	'events. Just clean them up.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Geeeh...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Dissatisfied?'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'O-Of course not!'
	R
	'Not even in the slightest!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Mhm, work hard.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/●'
	R
	'I finished up JAPAN somehow,'
	R
	'so my hands were free.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Moomin, come here for a second.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Yes, what is it?'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］ It’d be nice if there was'
	R
	'a CG mode, and character endings'
	R
	'got listed when the game ends.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］ Yeah, it’d be great if'
	R
	'a bit more was put into little'
	R
	'things like that then usual!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［ＴＡＤＡ］'
	R
	'Mhm, then you be the one to'
	R
	'make them that way.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Huh...? Me?'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, I tried, but they'
	R
	'might’ve turned out pretty'
	R
	'normal.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I tried harder than with any'
	R
	'other game though.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/■'
	R
	'It’s about time to get serious'
	R
	'about debugging.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'Well, I’m off.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Tori］'
	R
	'Wait, you can go home?'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］'
	R
	'What do you mean, can I?'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Tori］ If you think you can go'
	R
	'back at a regular time then you'
	R
	'could be checking for typos.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］ I’m working on JAPAN.'
	R
	'That’s what I’m in charge of for'
	R
	'this game, eheheh.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］ And I’m working on it'
	R
	'alone, so that’s all I can work'
	R
	'on. TADA’s orders, eheheh.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Tori］'
	R
	'You, you’re just a slave you'
	R
	'know! A slaaaaaave!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'...But I’m probably only going'
	R
	'to have this kind of time for a'
	R
	'week.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Not very long, I have to enjoy'
	R
	'it...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ＄/￡'
	R
	'I’m gonna die. Aah...'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'It does look like the diary'
	R
	'entries get more half-assed at'
	R
	'this point.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'The writing looks even worse,'
	R
	'too...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, it was for my game, no'
	R
	'point caring about one or two'
	R
	'sacrifices like this.'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	@L_00e17:
*L_006bd:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'A guy who makes games that still'
	R
	'tries to play games... He spends'
	R
	'whole days playing them.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'He’s probably an addict.'
	R
	'How pitiful.'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00ecb:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ×/＆ I don’t need an N64.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I prefer my games about'
	R
	'mustachioed adults as'
	R
	'sidescrollers.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ▼/★ My Super Famicom’s in'
	R
	'bad shape.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I bought it on release day with'
	R
	'Mario and F-Zero.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Maybe this happening when the'
	R
	'Super Famicom’s on its way out'
	R
	'is a sign I should move on.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ▼/◆'
	R
	'Nevermind, it started working'
	R
	'again after I hit it.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/● In this age where'
	R
	'Sakura Taisen’s popular, I’m'
	R
	'playing Wizardry Gaiden.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'But the boring parts are'
	R
	'sticking out more and more to'
	R
	'me, it’s a little unfortunate.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/〓'
	R
	'I’m pretty late, but I finally'
	R
	'played Resident Evil.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'The Colt Python and grenades are'
	R
	'nice, but I thought the Beretta'
	R
	'was the most fun weapon.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Apparently after you play it a'
	R
	'few times, you unlock the rocket'
	R
	'launcher to use. I wanna try it.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ＄/＠ I played \"Marvelous\"'
	R
	'on the Super Famicom. (I play a'
	R
	'lot of Super Famicom).'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I haven’t played an adventure'
	R
	'game that good in a while.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I was hoping for more when I got'
	R
	'to the ending, though.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: ＄/§'
	R
	'I have less and less time for'
	R
	'games... Aah... Games...'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'Ugh, the handwriting’s getting'
	R
	'shaky... It’s like he was'
	R
	'going through withdrawal.'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	@L_00e17:
*L_008b9:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'Cars? I’m pretty sure he’s'
	R
	'said...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'［Moomin］ You don’t really need a'
	R
	'car in Osaka.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Wherever you go there’s plenty'
	R
	'of buses or trains.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah... What a jerk.'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00ecb:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/↑ Got a driver’s'
	R
	'license. My picture looks awful.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, my face isn’t great'
	R
	'anyway.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/↓ Still looking for a'
	R
	'car.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I made a dumb choice, there’s no'
	R
	'way there’s a used MT RV.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/※ Found one! A used MT'
	R
	'Mitsubishi RVR! The color I'
	R
	'wanted, too! Is my luck good?!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, I entered the'
	R
	'contract for it immediately.'
	R
	'Uhyohyoh, I’m happy.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/♂ It finally arrived.'
	R
	'Bought a car stereo and'
	R
	'navigator the same day.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'...I also scratched my car the'
	R
	'same day. This sucks.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/♀ Wandering around'
	R
	'relying on the navigator. I can'
	R
	'really get around!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I love this thing!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/〒 The MT’s tough. I'
	R
	'stall the engine all the time.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'When I try accelerating it just'
	R
	'dies.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Then sometimes when I step on'
	R
	'accelerate in neutral gear, it'
	R
	'still accelerates...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'But Osakan roads are narrow.'
	R
	'This is like a LV1 adventurer'
	R
	'fighting the last boss.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'The MT’s problems make it worse.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'But either way my driving'
	R
	'experience is going up...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'So it’s fine. I can still get'
	R
	'through this.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Date: △/÷ I can only drive'
	R
	'Saturdays now, and soon I have'
	R
	'to work then too...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I wanna drive...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'When Rance is done I’ll go'
	R
	'somewhere a bit far away. Until'
	R
	'then... I’ll wait!'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I can do this!!'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'...What an idiot.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm, still more written here?'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00ecb:
	ZH 1:
	'Lastly...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Keyaki Morino gave me advice and'
	R
	'helped me around used car places'
	R
	'when I was looking for a car.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'And Nagi did most of the'
	R
	'wiring for the stereo and'
	R
	'navigator.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'It was funny when she was'
	R
	'working on it late at night and'
	R
	'got questioned by the police,'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'though.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'Thanks, both of you!'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	\L_00e93:
	ZH 1:
	'Did this guy put personal'
	R
	'thanks into my game?!'
	R
	'What the hell?!'
	\L_00fb8:
	\L_00fab:
	@L_00e17:
