	'before...'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I write what song I listened'
	R
	'to a lot or that I’m glad I'
	R
	'listened to during work.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sure nobody remembers what I'
	R
	'did before anyway,'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'but it’s apparent I only listen'
	R
	'to normal, trendy music.'
	\L_00fb8:
	ZH 1:
	'ＢＧＭ＠Ｍｒ．Ｃｈｉｌｄｒｅｎ 　　「ＬＯＶＥ」 　'
